CAVEAT Language: agent demo
Illustrative inputs supplied by this demo; the scores are not measured confidence.
Program: examples/agent-evidence/assessment.cav

1. observe {"confidence":85}
   observations@1 = 85; supports answer_supported
   No decision yet: observing is separate from assessing.

2. assess
   assessment@1 = 85; in force
   Grounds: observations@1; caveats: none

3. retract
   observations@1 withdrawn because recheck; its archive remains.
   assessment@1 = 85; reopened
   Grounds: observations@1; caveats: none

4. observe {"confidence":92}
   observations@2 = 92; supports answer_supported
   assessment@1 = 85; reopened
   Grounds: observations@1; caveats: none

5. assess
   assessment@2 = 92; in force
   Grounds: observations@2; caveats: none

assessment@1 is superseded; original grounds preserved: observations@1.
Caveat records supplied evidence and authored policy; it does not establish that either is true.

